lor themes for each lesson (Gold `#F6C945`, Black `#30313A`, Red `#E84C4F`, White `#FFFFFF`, Green `#43A66C`, Blue `#4C91E2`).\\n- **Key Screens & Flows**:\\n  1. **Splash Screen**: Animated glowing Bible & cross with colorful gradient background (`#DFF3FF` to `#F6C945` & `#FF9F43`) transitioning smoothly to Home.\\n  2. **Home Screen**: Welcoming greeting (\\\"Hello, Little Bible Explorer!\\\"), 6 main cards (Learn Colors, Bible Verses, Color Quiz, Learning Journey, Prayer Time, Parents & Teachers), and quick footer.\\n  3. **Learn the Colors (List & Detail)**: Grid of 6 color lessons with icons, progress indicators, and rich detail screens featuring KJV verses, practical applications, prayers, \\\"Remember This\\\" takeaways, and bookmarking.\\n  4. **Bible Verse Library**: Searchable collection of all KJV verses organized by color/lesson with copy, bookmark, and optional TTS read-aloud buttons.\\n  5. **Multiple-Choice Quiz**: 30 questions (5 per color) with 4 choices, immediate positive feedback, score tracking, best score persistence, and completion badges.\\n  6. **My Learning Journey**: Visual progress tracker showing completed lessons, earned stars, quiz scores, and completion badge.\\n  7. **Prayer Time**: Collection of 8 child-friendly prayers (Morning, Evening, Wisdom, Forgiveness, Family, Friends, Courage, Thank You) with TTS support.\\n  8. **Parents & Teachers Guide**: Practical tips, discussion questions, devotion ideas, and guidance on explaining salvation gently.\\n  9. **Favorites / Bookmarks & About / Privacy**: Manage saved lessons/verses/prayers and view offline privacy details.\\n\\n## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs\\n\\n- **Local Storage**: Use `SharedPreferences` / `DataStore` or lightweight Room database for saving bookmarks, quiz scores, and completed lessons locally and reliably across app restarts.\\n- **Text-to-Speech (TTS)**: Uses Android\'s built-In `TextToSpeech` engine with robust null checks and graceful fallbacks if speech data is unavailable.\\n- **Offline Assets**: All illustrations, icons, and text data are bundled locally in resources and Kotlin data classes.\\n\\n## 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                        UI Layer                        \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202 (Jetpack Compose, Material 3, Navigation Compose)       \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n                           \342\224\202\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\2