            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> [!IMPORTANT]"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Confirmed Choices**: Optional audio buttons for text-to-speech, immediate feedback with positive encouragement for quizzes, and warm cream background with vibrant multi-color accents."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Offline First**: All lessons, verses, quizzes, and prayers are stored locally and work 100% offline in airplane mode."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Zero External Backend / Login**: Fully self-contained local storage using Room or DataStore for progress, quiz scores, and bookmarks."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 1. Overview & Core Concept"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **What It Does**: An engaging, child-friendly Christian Bible app for children ages 4\342\200\22312. It guides young explorers through the 6 Colors of Salvation, offering interactive lessons, KJV scripture verses, quizzes with instant positive feedback, prayer cards, progress tracking, and bookmarking."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Target Audience**: Children, parents, and Sunday school teachers seeking wholesome, Bible-centered educational content."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Key Value**: 100% offline reliability, beautiful illustrated Christian visual identity (open Bible, cross, radiant light, colorful ribbons), positive reinforcement, and comprehensive offline scripture/prayer resources."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 2. User Experience & Visual Design"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Visual Identity**: Warm cream background (`#FFF9F0`), dark charcoal text (`#263238`), and vibrant color themes for each lesson (Gold `#F6C945`, Black `#30313A`, Red `#E84C4F`, White `#FFFFFF`, Green `#43A66C`, Blue `#4C91E2`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Key Screens & Flows**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  1. **Splash Screen**: Animated glowing Bible & cross with colorful gradient background (`#DFF3FF` to `#F6C945` & `#FF9F43`) transitioning smoothly to Home."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  2. **Home Screen**: Welcoming greeting (\"Hello, Little Bible Explorer!\"), 6 main cards (Learn Colors, Bible Verses, Color Quiz, Learning Journey, Prayer Time, Parents & Teachers), and quick footer."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  3. **Learn the Colors (List & Detail)**: Grid of 6 color lessons with icons, progress indicators, and rich detail screens featuring KJV verses, practical applications, prayers, \"Remember This\" takeaways, and bookmarking."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  4. **Bible Verse Library**: Searchable collection of all KJV verses organized by color/lesson with copy, bookmark, and optional TTS read-aloud buttons."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  5. **Multiple-Choice Quiz**: 30 questions (5 per color) with 4 choices, immediate positive feedback, score tracking, best score persistence, and completion badges."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  6. **My Learning Journey**: Visual progress tracker showing completed lessons, earned stars, quiz scores, and completion badge."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  7. **Prayer Time**: Collection of 8 child-friendly prayers (Morning, Evening, Wisdom, Forgiveness, Family, Friends, Courage, Thank You) with TTS support."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  8. **Parents & Teachers Guide**: Practical tips, discussion questions, devotion ideas, and guidance on explaining salvation gently."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  9. **Favorites / Bookmarks & About / Privacy**: Manage saved lessons/verses/prayers and view offline privacy details."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Local Storage**: Use `SharedPreferences` / `DataStore` or lightweight Room database for saving bookmarks, quiz scores, and completed lessons locally and reliably across app restarts."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Text-to-Speech (TTS)**: Uses Android\'s built-In `TextToSpeech` engine with robust null checks and graceful fallbacks if speech data is unavailable."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Offline Assets**: All illustrations, icons, and text data are bundled locally in resources and Kotlin data classes."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
