              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "            content = \"The Colors of Salvation (often called the Wordless Book) is a wonderful, time-tested teaching tool using simple colors to explain the Christian message of the Gospel to children. Each color represents a key biblical truth about God\'s love, our human condition, Christ\'s sacrifice, forgiveness, spiritual growth, and trust.\","
