            lines {
              text: "            title = \"Explaining Sin and Forgiveness Gently\","
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "            content = \"When talking about sin (the black color), emphasize that everyone makes mistakes and falls short, but God loves us deeply. Avoid graphic descriptions or shaming language. The focus should quickly pivot to God\'s immense love and forgiveness through Jesus Christ (red and white colors).\","
