    thinking: "**Designing Color Lessons**\n\nI\'m currently designing the structure for the color lessons. I plan to build two primary screens: `ColorLessonsScreen.kt`, for displaying the lesson list, and `ColorLessonDetailScreen.kt`, which will offer a detailed view with illustrations and explanations suitable for children. I\'m focusing on the lesson layout.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
