  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully built and compiled **Colors of Faith \342\200\224 Bible for Kids**, a fully offline, vibrant, and polished Android application designed to teach children the Christian message of salvation through the traditional Colors of Salvation concept.\n\n### Summary of Features Implemented:\n1. **Colorful Christian Splash Screen**: Features an animated glowing Holy Bible and cross illustration with a vibrant gradient background and welcoming typography.\n2. **Interactive Home Screen**: Warm cream background featuring a welcoming greeting (\"Hello, Little Bible Explorer!\") and responsive navigation cards for all major features.\n3. **The Six Colors of Salvation**: Complete lessons for Gold (God\'s Glory), Black (Forgiveness), Red (Jesus\' Sacrifice), White (Clean Heart), Green (Spiritual Growth), and Blue (Trusting God), complete with KJV scripture verses, practical applications, child-friendly prayers, \"Remember This\" takeaways, and bookmarking.\n4. **Bible Verse Library**: Searchable collection of KJV scriptures with copy-to-clipboard, bookmarking, and offline Text-to-Speech audio narration.\n5. **Multiple-Choice Quiz System**: 30 age-appropriate questions (5 per lesson) with four answer choices, immediate positive encouragement feedback, score persistence, and best score tracking.\n6. **My Learning Journey**: Visual progress tracker showing completed lessons, earned stars, quiz scores, and badge unlocking.\n7. **Prayer Time**: Collection of 8 child-friendly Christian prayers (Morning, Evening, Wisdom, Forgiveness, Family, Friends, Courage, and Thank You) with TTS read-aloud support.\n8. **Parents & Teachers Guide**: Practical tips, discussion questions, devotion ideas, and gentle guidance on explaining salvation.\n9. **Favorites & Privacy**: Dedicated management for bookmarked lessons, verses, and prayers, along with a 100% offline privacy guarantee."
    thinking: "**Reviewing The Build**\n\nI\'m pleased to report the initial build was successful. Now, I\'m meticulously reviewing all aspects of the application, starting with the app name, to ensure complete compliance with the prompt\'s requirements and user instructions. My focus is on absolute accuracy and adherence.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully built and compiled **Colors of Faith \342\200\224 Bible for Kids**, a fully offline, vibrant, and polished Android application designed to teach children the Christian message of salvation through the traditional Colors of Salvation concept.\n\n### Summary of Features Implemented:\n1. **Colorful Christian Splash Screen**: Features an animated glowing Holy Bible and cross illustration with a vibrant gradient background and welcoming typography.\n2. **Interactive Home Screen**: Warm cream background featuring a welcoming greeting (\"Hello, Little Bible Explorer!\") and responsive navigation cards for all major features.\n3. **The Six Colors of Salvation**: Complete lessons for Gold (God\'s Glory), Black (Forgiveness), Red (Jesus\' Sacrifice), White (Clean Heart), Green (Spiritual Growth), and Blue (Trusting God), complete with KJV scripture verses, practical applications, child-friendly prayers, \"Remember This\" takeaways, and bookmarking.\n4. **Bible Verse Library**: Searchable collection of KJV scriptures with copy-to-clipboard, bookmarking, and offline Text-to-Speech audio narration.\n5. **Multiple-Choice Quiz System**: 30 age-appropriate questions (5 per lesson) with four answer choices, immediate positive encouragement feedback, score persistence, and best score tracking.\n6. **My Learning Journey**: Visual progress tracker showing completed lessons, earned stars, quiz scores, and badge unlocking.\n7. **Prayer Time**: Collection of 8 child-friendly Christian prayers (Morning, Evening, Wisdom, Forgiveness, Family, Friends, Courage, and Thank You) with TTS read-aloud support.\n8. **Parents & Teachers Guide**: Practical tips, discussion questions, devotion ideas, and gentle guidance on explaining salvation.\n9. **Favorites & Privacy**: Dedicated management for bookmarked lessons, verses, and prayers, along with a 100% offline privacy guarantee."
