  planner_response {
    response: "I have created the robust data model and comprehensive UI structure for the **Colors of Salvation** lesson plan, where each color corresponds to a foundational aspect of faith:\n\n1. **Data Model (`ColorLesson` & `BibleVerseItem`)**:\n   - Stores color properties (name, hex color code), lesson title, biblical meaning, child-friendly explanations, verified KJV scripture references, practical life applications, child prayers, and \"Remember This\" takeaways.\n\n2. **UI Structure**:\n   - **`ColorLessonsScreen`**: Presents an overview card list of all six salvation colors (Gold, Black, Red, White, Green, and Blue) with completion badges and quiz scores.\n   - **`ColorLessonDetailScreen`**: Provides an immersive, color-themed lesson view with custom illustration headers, scripture cards, prayer sections, bookmarking, and offline Text-to-Speech audio narration buttons."
